-| 13 | Collapsible no affordance | **TRUE** |
-| 14 | Reset button hover-only danger | **TRUE** |
-| 15 | Contributor CSS punctuation | **PARTIALLY VESTIGIAL** — `dd::after` rules exist but HtmlNormalizer replaces `<dl>` with `<ul>` |
-| 16 | Inline pill badges | **TRUE** |
